{"strongs": "H8127", "word": "שֵׁן", "translit": "shen", "root": "שן", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "tooth, ivory", "definition": "I. שֵׁן noun feminine 1Sam 2:13 (yet masculine 1Sam 14:5 compare Dr ) tooth, ivory ; — ׳ שׁ absolute Exod 21:24 +, construct v Exod 21:27 +, ׳ שֶׁן Deut 32:24 suffix שִׁנּם Exod 21:27 dual שִׁנַּיִם Prov 10:26 , construct שִׁנֵּי Jer 31:29 +; suffix שִׁנֵּיהֶם Ps 124:6 , שִׁנֵּימוֺ Ps 58:7 , etc.; — 1. tooth: \\ \\ a. of man, Exod 21:27 (3 t. in verse) ( E ), Num 11:33 ( J ), Gen 49:12 (poem in J ), Amos 4:6 ; Song 4:2 ; Song 6:6 , רֹעָה ׳ שׁ Prov 25:19 , see II. רעע 2 ; of lex talionis , ׳ תַּחַת שׁ ׳ שׁ Exod 21:24 ( E ), Lev 24:20 ( H ), ׳ שֵׁן בְּשׁ Deut 19:21 irritated by acid Prov 10:26 , dulled by it (in proverb of inherited guilt) Jer 31:29 ; Jer 31:30 ; Ezek 18:2 ׳ חָרַק שׁ Lam 2:16 ; Job 16:9 ; Ps 35:16 ; Ps 112:10 , see חָרַק ; אֶשָּׂא בְשָׂרִי בְשִׁנָּ֑י Job 13:14 = risk my life (strike out עַלמָֿה , dittograph; || אָשִׂים בְּכַּ פִּי נַפְשִׁי ); בְּעוֺר שִׁנָּ֑י Job 19:20 , see מָלַט Hithpa`el (other conjectures see Di Bi Bu Du ). \\ \\ b. of beasts : Deut 32:24 , crocodile Job 41:6 , locusts Joel 1:6 (teeth of lions); especially figurative of false prophets Mic 3:5 , of foes Zech 9:7 , oppressors Job 29:17 , wicked Job 4:10 ; Ps 3:8 ; Ps 58:7 ; Ps 124:6 of their weapons Prov 30:14 ; Ps 57:5 of Israel shattered by ׳ י . \\ \\ c. tooth of a fork, tine , 1Sam 2:13 (compare Dr Sm. 291 ); of cliff, שֵׁן הַסֶּלַע 1Sam 14:4 (twice in verse), compare Job 39:28 , הַשֵּׁן 1Sam 14:5 . 2. ivory , of commerce, קַרְנוֺת שֵׁן Ezek 27:15 (i.e. tusks? ); as material, ׳ מִטּוֺת שׁ Amos 6:4 , ׳ כִּסֵּאשֿׁ 1Kgs 10:18 = 2Chr 9:17 , ׳ בֵּית הַשּׁ 1Kgs 22:39 , compare Amos 3:15 , ׳ הֵיכְלֵי שׁ Ps 45:9 , also Ezek 27:6 ; Song 5:15 ; Song 7:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8891')\">BDB8891</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8127')\">H8127</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8890