 1:6\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,6)\">Joel 1:6</ref> (teeth of lions); especially figurative of false prophets <ref ref=\"Mic 3:5\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,5)\">Mic 3:5</ref>, of foes <ref ref=\"Zech 9:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,9,7)\">Zech 9:7</ref>, oppressors <ref ref=\"Job 29:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,17)\">Job 29:17</ref>, wicked <ref ref=\"Job 4:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,10)\">Job 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 3:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,3,8)\">Ps 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 58:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,7)\">Ps 58:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 124:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"124\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"124\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,124,6)\">Ps 124:6</ref> of their weapons <ref ref=\"Prov 30:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,14)\">Prov 30:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 57:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,57,5)\">Ps 57:5</ref> of Israel shattered by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>tooth</highlight> of a fork, <highlight>tine</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,13)\">1Sam 2:13</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Sm. 291</sup></lookup>); of cliff, <bdbheb>שֵׁן הַסֶּלַע</bdbheb><ref ref=\"1Sam 14:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,4)\">1Sam 14:4</ref> (twice in verse), compare <ref ref=\"Job 39:28\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,28)\">Job 39:28</ref>, <bdbheb>הַשֵּׁן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,5)\">1Sam 14:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>ivory</highlight>, of commerce, <bdbheb>קַרְנוֺת שֵׁן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,15)\">Ezek 27:15</ref> (i.e. <highlight>tusks?</highlight>); as material, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִטּוֺת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 6:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,4)\">Amos 6:4</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כִּסֵּאשֿׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,18)\">1Kgs 10:18</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,17)\">2Chr 9:17</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:39\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,39)\">1Kgs 22:39</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Amos 3:15\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,15)\">Amos 3:15</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,9)\">Ps 45:9</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,6)\">Ezek 27:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 5:15\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,15)\">Song 5:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 7:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,5)\">Song 7:5</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 2:13", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Sam 14:5", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 21:24", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Exod 21:27", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse":